## Query Structure Deep Dive

### Example Query Container Structure

When you call `query.pack()`, the container includes:

```
Container Structure:
[
    1: Query metadata (name, description, etc.)
    2: [Data Source 1
        - Table ID
        - Data source name
        - Join mode
        - [Relations array]
        - [Ranges array]
        - [Nested data sources]
    ]
    3: [Data Source 2]
    ...
    N: [OrderBy array]
    N+1: [GroupBy array]
]
```

### Preserved Elements

#### 1. Table Joins

All join types are preserved:

```xpp
// Inner Join
qbds2.joinMode(JoinMode::InnerJoin);

// Outer Join
qbds2.joinMode(JoinMode::OuterJoin);

// Exists Join
qbds2.joinMode(JoinMode::ExistsJoin);

// Not Exists Join
qbds2.joinMode(JoinMode::NotExistsJoin);
```

#### 2. Relations (Custom Joins)

```xpp
// Standard relation
qbds2.addLink(fieldNum(Table1, Field1), fieldNum(Table2, Field2));

// Complex relation
qbds2.relations(true); // Enable relation processing
```

#### 3. Range Filters

All range types are preserved:

```xpp
// Simple value
qbr.value("ABC");

// Multiple values
qbr.value("ABC,XYZ,123");

// Range
qbr.value("A..Z");

// Greater than
qbr.value(">100");

// Complex expression
qbr.value("((Field1 > 0) && (Field2 < 100))");

// Date range
qbr.value(queryValue(fromDate) + ".." + queryValue(toDate));
```

#### 4. Field Selections

```xpp
// Dynamic fields (all fields)
qbds.fields().dynamic(true);

// Specific fields
qbds.addSelectionField(fieldNum(Table1, Field1));
qbds.addSelectionField(fieldNum(Table1, Field2));
```

#### 5. Sorting

```xpp
qbds.addOrderByField(fieldNum(Table1, Field1));
qbds.addOrderByField(fieldNum(Table1, Field2), SortOrder::Descending);
```

