## Testing the Query Clone

### Verification Script

```xpp
static void AVA_TestQueryClone(Args _args)
{
    WHSLocDirAction sourceAction, newAction;
    Query sourceQuery, clonedQuery;
    QueryBuildDataSource sourceDs, clonedDs;
    QueryBuildRange sourceRange, clonedRange;
    
    // Select a source action
    select firstonly sourceAction
        where sourceAction.QueryCriteria != conNull();
    
    // Clone the query
    sourceQuery = new Query();
    sourceQuery.unpack(sourceAction.QueryCriteria);
    
    clonedQuery = AVAWHSLocDirActionQueryHelper::cloneQuery(sourceQuery);
    
    // Compare data sources
    sourceDs = sourceQuery.dataSourceNo(1);
    clonedDs = clonedQuery.dataSourceNo(1);
    
    info(strFmt("Source DS: %1", sourceDs.name()));
    info(strFmt("Cloned DS: %1", clonedDs.name()));
    
    // Compare ranges
    sourceRange = sourceDs.rangeNo(1);
    clonedRange = clonedDs.rangeNo(1);
    
    info(strFmt("Source Range: %1 = %2", sourceRange.name(), sourceRange.value()));
    info(strFmt("Cloned Range: %1 = %2", clonedRange.name(), clonedRange.value()));
    
    // Verify they are different objects
    info(strFmt("Different objects: %1", sourceQuery != clonedQuery));
}
```

### Visual Verification

1. Open source action in form
2. Click "Edit query" button
3. Note all ranges, joins, sorting
4. Copy to batch
5. Open new action in form
6. Click "Edit query" button
7. Verify all elements match source

